iv class=\"step-idx\">02</div>\n      <div class=\"step-body\">\n        <div class=\"step-title\">统一收敛<span class=\"chip gold\">汇总复盘</span></div>\n        <p class=\"step-text\">问题经汇总复盘统一收敛，不散落在各组内部。</p>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"scope\">\n    <div class=\"scope-label\">范围边界</div>\n    <p class=\"scope-text\">资料未给出反馈时限、责任人与处理细则，<strong>本方案不做补充</strong>。</p>\n    <div class=\"scope-tag\">待补充</div>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"page-no\">5 / 6</div>\n</main>\n</body></html>","reasoning_content":"I need to fix the scope band text. Keep everything else the same.\n\nNew text: \"资料未给出反馈时限、责任人与处理细则，本方案不做补充\" — with strong on \"本方案不做补充\"."},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":10214,"completion_tokens":3848,"total_tokens":14062,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":6144},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":45},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":6144,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":4070},"system_fingerprint":"bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}